+ Never promise a specific day.
+
+ --- Tone (Tone) ---
+ Warm, direct.
+
+ --- Destination: New Zealand (NZ pricing) ---
+ Guided day 1 440 NZD + 60 NZD licence. Full days only.
+
+ --- Guide (g-42) (Guide Sam) ---
